  "description": "ToolUp.OpenXml — shared structural / revision layer over DocumentFormat.OpenXml for ToolUp.Platform consumers. Imports .docx into an immutable typed structural model (headings, styled runs, tables, numbering, comments, revisions) with an explicit lossy-residue report naming everything the model did not capture; emits the model back to .docx; and lowers programmatic edit sets to native Word tracked changes (w:ins / w:del runs + comment parts with author attribution) a reviewer can accept or reject in Word.",
